@startuml
title Alarm Clock State Machine

[*] --> Off

Off --> ActiveAlarm : Set Alarm Time
ActiveAlarm --> RingingAlarm : Match Current Time with Alarm Time
RingingAlarm --> StoppedAlarm : Turn Off Alarm / Stop Ringing
StoppedAlarm --> ActiveAlarm : Next Scheduled Alarm Time

state "Off" as Off
state "ActiveAlarm" as ActiveAlarm
state "RingingAlarm" as RingingAlarm
state "StoppedAlarm" as StoppedAlarm

Off --> ActiveAlarm : Turn On Alarm

ActiveAlarm --> Off : Turn Off Alarm
ActiveAlarm --> RingingAlarm : Current Time matches Set Alarm Time

RingingAlarm --> Off : Turn Off Alarm / Stop Ringing
@enduml
